  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "5G專網與應用",
    "sub_ename": "5G CORE NETWORKS AND APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在介紹5G通訊技術的最新發展，以及5G專網網路架構，透過實際的連網實作，讓同學深入了解5G專網的實務應用，並能熟練5G網路技術，從而提升在未來資通訊產業中的競爭力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to provide an in-depth understanding of the latest developments in 5G communication technology and the architecture of 5G core networks. Through hands-on networking exercises, students will gain practical insights into the real-world applications of 5G core networks, enabling them to master 5G network technology and enhance their competitiveness in the future telecommunications industry.",
